WEBVTT

00:15:27.846 --> 00:15:30.943
I've got to do one about Steve Jobs.

00:15:30.967 --> 00:15:31.975
(Music)

00:15:31.999 --> 00:15:35.015
It won't be easy.
You'll think I'm strange.

00:15:35.039 --> 00:15:36.183
(Laughter)

00:15:36.207 --> 00:15:38.516
When I try to explain why I'm back,

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:41.631
after telling the press
Apple's future is black.

00:15:41.655 --> 00:15:44.250
You won't believe me.

00:15:44.274 --> 00:15:48.976
All that you see is a kid in his teens
who started out in a garage

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:51.976
with only a buddy named Woz.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.552
(Laughter)

00:15:53.576 --> 00:15:55.309
You try rhyming with garage!

00:15:55.333 --> 00:15:57.775
(Laughter)

00:15:57.799 --> 00:16:00.674
Don't cry for me, Cupertino.